<h3>WHAT YOU&rsquo;LL GAIN</h3>
<p>Through tCAP, you&rsquo;ll discover opportunities to:</p>
<ul>
<li>Explore internship and job opportunities</li>
<li>Build connections with employers and Bellini College alumni</li>
<li>Receive career guidance and mentoring</li>
<li>Gain hands-on, real-world experience</li>
</ul>
<h3>WHO SHOULD ATTEND</h3>
<p>All undergraduate students in Bellini College interested in careers in AI, cybersecurity, and computing. Whether you&rsquo;re just beginning your college journey or preparing to enter the workforce, tCAP is designed to help you move from classroom to career.</p>
<p>All class levels are welcome!</p>
<h3>WHAT TO EXPECT</h3>
<p>Join us for an engaging afternoon featuring interactive sessions, networking, and opportunities to connect with employers, alumni, mentors, faculty, and staff.</p>
<h6>Morning refreshments and lunch will be provided.</h6>
<h3>PARKING</h3>
<p>Complimentary event parking is available for registered guests. Please park in <strong>Lot 22D or 22D</strong>. Please follow the event parking signage.</p>
<p>Please visit USF Parking &amp; Transportation Services for more parking information and the campus parking map.</p>
<p><a href="/parking/parking/visitor-parking.aspx?utm_source=chatgpt.com">USF Visitor Parking Information</a><br /><a href="/parking/maps/?utm_source=chatgpt.com">USF Campus Parking Maps</a></p>
<h3>BE PART OF THE LAUNCH</h3>
<p>Be among the first students to experience <strong>tCAP</strong> and discover how this new initiative can help you build connections, gain experience, and accelerate your career.</p>
<p><strong>Your event hub is just a click away.</strong> Bookmark this page for the latest agenda, logistics, parking information, and event announcements as October 12 approaches.</p>


</td>
</tr>
